para("| 6 | Technical | Submissions are not in English |", "| 6 | Technical | Submissions are not in English | The dense encoder is multilingual and BM25 uses language-specific analysis where the toolkit provides it; substitute-data results are reported as language-mismatched if no same-language substitute exists |")
